{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>原定於明日揭幕並有近30位日本女優坐鎮之大型成人展MEGA FANS EXPO突遭取消，多名參展嘉賓在社交平台發文指未能順利過關並須即時遣返日本。正當外界震驚一眾人氣女優集體遭遇入境風波之際，官方機構終於打破沉默交代當日過關現場之真實情況。原來眾人未能在香港與粉絲見面背後隱藏另一內情。官方入境事務處澄清...</p>\n<p>原定於明日揭幕並有近30位日本女優坐鎮之大型成人展MEGA FANS EXPO突遭取消，多名參展嘉賓在社交平台發文指未能順利過關並須即時遣返日本。正當外界震驚一眾人氣女優集體遭遇入境風波之際，官方機構終於打破沉默交代當日過關現場之真實情況。原來眾人未能在香港與粉絲見面背後隱藏另一內情。</p>\n<h2>官方入境事務處澄清傳聞不實</h2>\n<p>針對外界盛傳多名女優慘遭原機遣返，入境事務處正式回覆傳媒查詢並作出澄清，指出相關人士在得悉活動取消後自行選擇離港，強調「並非遭拒絕入境」，直指網上傳聞內容並不屬實。主辦方亞洲娛樂集團其後正式發布新聞稿宣布活動連同預覽日全面取消，當傳媒致電聯絡集團董事蔡偉森了解內情時，他僅表示「而家唔方便傾電話，我哋稍後會有公布」，當被追問是否涉及女優入境問題時更隨即掛斷電話，而官方售票平台KKday則向已購票人士發訊息交代將會安排全額退款。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445362940593451_10782061806af5307e5ba22.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"R00dJBlQiS3WeMvexQrn1ar1ewXUdR5qCFgnTQhYJ00.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445362940593451_10782061806af5307e5ba22.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MFX）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>大槻響抵港後突接獲遣返通知</h2>\n<p>該大型成人展原定於11月13日至15日一連三天假富豪機場酒店舉行，惟多位重磅嘉賓昨日抵達香港機場時卻發生突發狀況。知名女優大槻響在社交平台發文透露自己雖然已經抵達香港，但其經理人團隊及同行女演員全部無法順利入境，最終大隊不得不折返日本。她在文中坦言事前已妥善辦理簽證手續，對於突發狀況感到極度震驚，更直言「這種事還是第一次，嚇了一跳」，而同行的青空光及宮下玲奈等亦相繼向粉絲透露全員必須強制返回日本。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363163547363_6063413706af5307fed0f9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"C1KQ_sVdyf3EbVn7FB10czZCwuf8QTDV4D7MS-A-zEs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363163547363_6063413706af5307fed0f9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MFX）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>波多野結衣大嘆未能與港迷見面</h2>\n<p>是次名為MEGA FANS EXPO之大型成人展被譽為香港歷來首個同類型震撼盛事，官方原先公布將會豪氣邀請近30名日本人氣女優親臨現場助陣，當中陣容包括在亞洲地區擁有極高知名度並獲封暗黑林志玲稱號之波多野結衣。大會原本安排4大主題房間讓入場人士參與專屬粉絲見面會，並設有近距離交流環節及精彩舞台表演。波多野結衣在事件發生後透過社交平台發文，坦言自己已經抵達香港並原本期待久違地參與海外大型活動，對最終未能出席感到極度遺憾。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363337112581_17377635916af53081b83cf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0qFRCuQ_Pf4j0FmpvgNBV6Jf7NBxC3LoHWBENR1gRDU.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363337112581_17377635916af53081b83cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>波多野結衣大嘆未能與港迷見面（圖片來源：波多野結衣X）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民熱議主辦方亞洲娛樂集團</h2>\n<p>展覽臨門一腳突然宣布告吹兼引發羅生門風波，大批早已購票準備朝聖之網民紛紛在各大討論區表達強烈不滿。不少粉絲對於期待已久之見面會瞬間化為烏有感到極度崩潰，留言直斥「好不甘心好難過」、「咁大個活動點解搞成咁」，更有網民將矛頭直指主辦方統籌能力出現嚴重問題。部分網民對於官方及各方各執一詞之說法抱持懷疑態度，紛紛要求盡快交代近30名嘉賓臨時決定集體折返日本背後是否牽涉合約或工作簽證漏報等行政失誤。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363572393545_19638862006af530840f07a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jOzf8CUjoZ0hJbqYzbQftOyXa17D7iKvH1Jgax9SYGs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363572393545_19638862006af530840f07a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>人氣女優瀨戶環奈（圖片來源：瀨戶環奈X）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363748857659_12107513466af53085e92c4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"phpP1xxtF.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363748857659_12107513466af53085e92c4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：瀨戶環奈X）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363839826825_8484415896af53086dc21f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"saika_kawakita__official_1714744813_3359845476496005053_49779563569.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445363839826825_8484415896af53086dc21f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>河北彩花原本亦會到港（圖片來源：河北彩花IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364049688734_19016350036af53088d2ee0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WWC1b1fCmFkHQSFyh6djhHXMGQsXhAWHoxgFxaMYBcU.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364049688734_19016350036af53088d2ee0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MFX）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364229652835_18475557026af5308aa9d42.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"QC1AGRpNGXTLfns_HaJTVOCY-ES6jZaE-6MfAfujHwE.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364229652835_18475557026af5308aa9d42.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MFX）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364522899835_19263952096af5308d9ec33.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tk-1OsbnkGVHjueTAxvhrE3B6eqLhkIY1PcgRtT3IEY.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364522899835_19263952096af5308d9ec33.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MFX）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364743211098_14148906456af5309036498.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"-JLZquv04b4c3Ta8Af6g8VR3QKKRJnSws573I7Oe9yM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445364743211098_14148906456af5309036498.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445365017297710_16711328286af53092e68d4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"pEJkkm0ZU04z4_ZQFL9bYsutucqXCYcTXInKQVyJykE.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179445365017297710_16711328286af53092e68d4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：MFX）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T03:27:48.571157+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1555,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T03:21:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:27.673440+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T03:21:20.582943+00:00","content_hash":"4c38861f3cf287f8ab6fe45067d797b7877fb7ee431144f2bb38aace63b0ed7e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}